+# The via-negativa engine: Primitive A/C's interception proxy and Primitive D's async RCA
+# worker (docs/specs/2026-09-13-via-negativa-engine.md). Brand new, like research-engine below
+# it in git history -- no copy Job, estate-db not estate-db-migrate, because there is no legacy
+# server. llm because the proxy fronts litellm and the RCA worker's fallback LLM call is a
+# router key (llm/config.yaml's `groq` row).
